WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.387
PPE and Medical Supply Procurement.

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:08.962
When the pandemic struck, Canada discovered it could not fight a war without supplies.

00:00:08.962 --> 00:00:20.662
Decades of hollowing out domestic manufacturing left the country scrambling for PPE through expensive, chaotic emergency procurement that delivered substandard equipment in many cases.
